{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44267","headline":"夏日山居 · 鱼玄机","name":"夏日山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移得仙居此地来，花丛自徧不曾栽。\n庭前亚树张衣桁，坐上新泉泛酒杯。\n轩槛暗传深竹径，绮罗长拥乱书堆。\n闲乘画舫吟明月，信任轻风吹却回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}